@startuml
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Uploaded : file selected
Uploaded --> Rejected : [size > 50 MB or invalid magic bytes]
Rejected --> [*]
Uploaded --> Converted : [valid] / compute SHA-256, build image
Converted --> Uploaded : new file selected
Converted --> Classified : Run Detection / log event
Classified --> Explained : Grad-CAM requested
Classified --> Fused : capture analysed / fuse()
Explained --> Fused : capture analysed / fuse()
Classified --> Reported : report requested
Explained --> Reported : report requested
Fused --> Reported : report requested
Reported --> [*]
@enduml
